faqs:
  - q: "How do I join Coop Member?"
    a: "Your society sends you an invitation by text message or email. Open it and create your account. Your records will be there."
  - q: "Is my information safe?"
    a: "Only you and your society’s staff can see your records. Amounts stay hidden until you enter your PIN. You can download all your data at any time."
  - q: "My society isn’t on CoopCircle. Can I still use it?"
    a: "Coop Member shows your society’s records, so your society needs to join first. Tell your executives about us."
